  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Plastic Differential Gear Kit includes all the necessary gears and knurled shafts for assembling a differential. The completed differential can be combined with a gearbox built using the 030 Micro DC Motor and the 1:48 Single-axis Plastic Reduction Gear Kit to form a complete power transmission system."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Important Notices"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Lubrication: Apply appropriate plastic-safe lubricating grease to the gears before use to reduce wear and extend lifespan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Load limit: Avoid operating the gears under excessive load or high speeds beyond their designed limits, which may cause the plastic teeth to strip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Documentation</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!--3D模型--><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/d0aa0099d1ec4924937d7e527499650c/Plastic_Differential_Gear_Kit-LA026_3D_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/3d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>Solid Model</span> </a><!-- Application Instruction --><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/511ad752ad154146b1e8f8b485c5d61b/Plastic_Differential_Gear_Kit-LA026_Application_Instruction.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b8b3d60616b14735911fd9e5d068bd81/instruction.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/><span>Application Instruction</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6;\"><em>*Solid Model: 3D digital models used to represent the actual dimensions and structural features.</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6;\"><em>*Application Instruction: Guide to assembling modules that support extended application cases.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Introduction-->\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Introduction</h2>\n<!---红字文本替换---->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The Plastic Differential Gear Kit includes all the necessary gears and knurled shafts for assembling a differential. The completed differential can be combined with a gearbox built using the <strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/030-micro-dc-motor-with-sh1-0\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">030 Micro DC Motor</a></span></strong> and the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/single-axis-plastic-reduction-gear-kit?id=506968371846459409\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\"> 1:48 Single-axis Plastic Reduction Gear Kit </span></strong></a> </span>to form a complete power transmission system.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lubrication</strong>: Apply appropriate plastic-safe lubricating grease to the gears before use to reduce wear and extend lifespan.</li>\n<li><strong>Load limit</strong>: Avoid operating the gears under excessive load or high speeds beyond their designed limits, which may cause the plastic teeth to strip.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The Plastic Differential Gear Kit includes all the necessary gears and knurled shafts for assembling a differential. The completed differential can be combined with a gearbox built using the 030 Micro DC Motor and the 1:48 Single-axis Plastic Reduction Gear Kit to form a complete power transmission system.\n\nLubrication: Apply appropriate plastic-safe lubricating grease to the gears before use to reduce wear and extend lifespan.\n\nLoad limit: Avoid operating the gears under excessive load or high speeds beyond their designed limits, which may cause the plastic teeth to strip.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
